<title>USA: Conseco, Bankers Life deal closes.</title>
<headline>Conseco, Bankers Life deal closes.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said Tuesday it completed its merger with Bankers Life Holding Corp.</p>
<p>Bankers Life shareholders will receive 0.3983 shares of Conseco common stock for each Bankers Life share they hold, the company said. In August, Conseco said the deal was worth about $117 million to shareholders.</p>
<p>Financial services company Conseco shares were down 1-1/8 at 62-3/4 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787)).</p>
</text>
